{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Description</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;I just want to Ask!&quot; is a medical registrar simulator with time management elements set in a provincial Russian hospital, featuring humorous elements. Your main task is to help patients, but each one has their own story.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Russian flavor with familiar characters and references;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Non-linear gameplay. Your decisions will influence the storyline;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lunch break as the meaning of life.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Game Modes</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story Mode</strong>: In this mode, you will immerse yourself in the stories of your patients and strive to become the best employee of the month, but at what cost?</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Challenge Mode</strong>: This mode offers several work shifts, each with a set of tasks to complete during the shift. It is recommended to play this mode after completing the story mode to enjoy and relax after a real workday. It's relaxing and entertaining ;)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3508580?t=1744154871","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508580/ac4fcc39d8ebc676f634852e0e10329269a7372e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744154871","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508580/8f2dbf1f170aa2dc76cc06b66377c2afc14d3078/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744154871","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3508580/8f2dbf1f170aa2dc76cc06b66377c2afc14d3078/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744154871","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}